<title>USA: President Casinos reopens Davenport site.</title>
<headline>President Casinos reopens Davenport site.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Casinos Inc said Monday it reopened its Davenport, Iowa, casino on Sunday.</p>
<p>Operations had been temporarily suspended on April 14 due to rising water levels on the Mississippi River.</p>
<p>President Casinos owns and operates riverboat and dockside gaming facilities in Davenport, Biloxi, Miss., and downtown St. Louis.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
